name=batman_Radio Survivor
id=batman_RadioSurvivor
description=Voices on the radio in Knox County. Radio characters played by an AI (Walt, a nurse, a deserter, a besieged family, a pirate station, a smuggler) answer on real frequencies, give missions and trades, and tell the server chronicle. The field notebook keeps your contacts, missions and reputation. With Living Knox (batman_LivingKnox, optional) you also meet groups of human survivors, earn their trust and take their missions in the notebook. Server authoritative, solo and multiplayer. AI dialogue needs the separate Python bridge (see the README); without it the game stays playable and the voices stay silent. Requires Belt Walkie-Talkie (batman_BeltRadio) and Signal Smoke (batman_SignalSmoke).
versionMin=42.21
modversion=0.3.0
require=\batman_RadioSurvivorCore,\batman_BeltRadio,\batman_SignalSmoke
loadModAfter=\batman_CharacterReputation
